      "text": "薄雾场地",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "BTR_STATE_07_02",
      "hash64": "1E0AC2A9F8CE9F8A",
      "text": "在５回合内，\\n地面上的宝可梦不会陷入异常状态。\\n龙属性招式的伤害也会减半。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
